id: STYLE-049
ilities: [modifiability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Inconsistent acronym casing (userID vs userId)
category: style
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: (const|let|var|function)\s+\w*[A-Z]{3,}\w*\s*[=:(]
    message: "ALL-CAPS acronym in camelCase (userID, parseXML) — use userId, parseXml for consistency"
fix: Treat acronyms as words in camelCase. userId not userID, parseXml not parseXML, httpClient not HTTPClient.
